  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>N</mi></math> be defined as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Then which of the following statements is true ?</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
